<title>USA: Visioneer president, CEO resigns.</title>
<headline>Visioneer president, CEO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Visioneer Inc said Mike McConnell has resigned as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said McConnell will remain on the board and Chairman J. Larry Smart will assume the titles of acting president and chief executive officer of Visioneer.</p>
</text>
